      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Completion (NFR-15)",
      "description": "Amendment 0007: completion of a command, from receipt to the state it asks for. The ceiling, 30 s at p99, pages; the target, 19 s at p99, is tracked here.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
