    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Core halt, the writer's fence and the runtime's Authority backlog (F18, T-037-15, VOS)",
      "description": "T-018-10: whether the core has stopped deciding (every input waits Received; core-halt runbook), how long its writer has been fenced (T-037-15: the code installed is not the code its state names; alert past fence_alert_after, five minutes), and the Authority decisions issued for invocations not yet acknowledged, against VOS's limit of 256.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
